    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Was that an earthquake just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're so close to the stage, after all! Did you see that? Did you see D.D.D.'s expression?! How did she do that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 4,
        "ystrength": 4,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "text": "She already left the stage, don't always be such a fanboy... Wait, isn't it shaking again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh come on, it's probably just the subwoofer... Wait...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "H-huh...? You felt that too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Let's go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't ask questions, just come with me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$runsand",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 4,
        "ystrength": 4,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop pushing! Some personal space here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Audience"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're stepping on my foot!! Get out of my face!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Audience"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone fainted! Watch out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Audience"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-why is everyone panicking? Don't tell me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh my god...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's Emperor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem, nice weather we're having.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Cheering)"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Emperor! It's really him!! Wooowwww...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be stupid! It's THE EMPEROR! And you still think it's some earthquake?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022",
        "name2": "avg_npc_021",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm just too excited, from seeing... Wait, I kind of... can't breathe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Emperor, this way please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ladies and gentlemen! Please move back! Stand behind the line!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, young man, that Savran over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. Let them come closer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But Mister Emperor, you still have a performance later. If some kind of accident were to happen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Accident?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean an attempted shooting, assassination, kidnapping, suicide threat, or something along those lines?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think those things can stop me? Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, those things shall only become a part of my show, just like how rhythm breaks apart the meaning of words. Do you understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, no...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "To put it simply, it's all theatrics. Just relax. I promise, Siren won't blame you for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Cheering)"
    },
    {
        "text": "Emperor!! Emperor!! Emperor!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Audience"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, you're here. Come, don't be nervous. Just relax, muster up some bravery, and believe in yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Columbia's Rap God? You're nothing but a thug, a mongrel that got a little lucky...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Louder, pal, let me hear you! Hey, Savran, don't drive him away. Give him the mic. Don't worry. Just do as I say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You ruined our lives, but you still sit atop so much wealth... You, you deserve only death!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_022"
    },
    {
        "text": "Noooo! He has a crossbow! Take cover!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't blame me. That's right, it's all your fault. Just how many singers were sacrificed for your so-called 'rap empire'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Emperor? Eat dirt, you bottom-feeding penguin!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahaha, let me think about that one. Who's the one playing dirty? Riling up the media, manipulating public opinion, personal attacks, and now even a shooting attempt? Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I'd forget who you are just because you decided to roll around in the sewers? Will pointing your weapon at these youngsters satisfy you, 'Songster?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I wasn't such a juicy target for you, how many rising stars would you have continued to 'eliminate' just for not suiting your tastes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long did you think you'd get away with spitting on the entirety of Columbia while stuffing your bathtub full of money?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up! Just die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Protect Mister Emperor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_amiyamag_h",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Emperor has been shot! Wait... what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Emperor was the one who shot first? That bastard's crossbow went flying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$emperor_intro",
        "key": "$emperor_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Ratatat tat! Bang!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "How strange. You were the one running your muzzle, but how come my muzzle is smoking first? Why don't ya take a guess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it because ya got no game, or is my brilliance that is to blame?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guh... You... even brought guns with you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you die several times every day, there are games that you just won't play.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*... Do you really... think I'm alone? Think about all the enemies you've made. You won't leave Siesta alive!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange-Looking Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "My past is more expansive than this sea of falsity; so where are these 'enemies' that await my majesty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Emperor! Many of his rabble are hidden among the audience. We can't deal with all of them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all right. Don't panic. Just maintain the order here, and leave the rest to the professionals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Professionals, like Penguin Logistics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If I remember properly, weren't we supposed to be on vacation? Just out of curiosity, are we getting paid overtime for this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I could use some exercise after being cooped up in that hotel room.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tex- err, I mean, 'Sora,' that's... because you stayed in the hotel reading books the whole time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Right, that was part of the agreement. Are you able to adapt to the battlefield?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss, we're all done here. Remember to snag me the front row seats for tomorrow's show!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Emperor, wh-who are these people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We are the Boss's... Well, Mister Emperor's private bodyguards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're a logistics company though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, since the beginning, our business covers quite a wide range of things. We even bought a jazz bar at some point, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There were also those Siracusan gangs that really liked being our punching bags. They've been behaving better recently though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many fights do you think we have in Lungmen every month?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "When it comes to brawls and firefights, we're the best you're going to find.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
